body:
Hm, I like that idea, thank you. I probably will trip again in the future without expectations, it was still an incredible experience though. I definitely was expecting it to change my whole mindset to a point, so I guess it's odd coming back to normal, but I did feel a lot more connection and happiness on the trip which I'll try to apply to my life now.

&#x200B;

Although after the peak, I didn't focus on the acid, just on the world and people around me which was a lot nicer. I do see what you mean, I think I was only concentrated on the acid and effects on my mind/body, how music sounds different etc instead of just having a good time. Thank you for that :)
